{"id":43156578006436,"type":"artist","name":"The Magnetic Fields","artist":null,"year":1990,"weight":29,"info":{"tags":["indie pop","indie","Lo-Fi","alternative","indie rock"],"country":"US","begin":"1990","kind":"Group","similar":["The 6ths","Stephin Merritt","Future Bible Heroes","Belle and Sebastian","Silver Jews","Yo La Tengo","The Gothic Archies","of Montreal","Beat Happening","Neutral Milk Hotel"],"img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Magnetic-fields-in-concert.jpg?width=500","bio":"The Magnetic Fields es una banda de New York encabezada por el compositor y cantante Stephin Merritt. Los álbumes lanzados por Merritt bajo el nombre de The Magnetic Fields se les puede definir como un Synth Pop con reminiscencias ochentenas y bonitas letras, comúnmente sobre amor, a veces irónicas, a veces tristes, otras más festivas. Mientras que en los álbumes The Wayward Bus y Distant Plastic Trees predomina la voz de Susan Anway, en el resto de los álbumes los temas son cantados principalmente por el propio Merritt."},"works":[{"id":181390939152857,"type":"album","name":"Distant Plastic Trees","artist":"Magnetic Fields","year":1991,"weight":6,"yt":"uiSL1InaSZg","src":"books","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[],"n_lists":0}},{"id":212824865310531,"type":"album","name":"The House Of Tomorrow","artist":"Magnetic Fields","year":1992,"weight":8,"yt":"aP_eqZq93mw","src":"charts,musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":55316938071026,"name":"Sputnikmusic Best Albums 1992","rank":191,"scaruffi":7.0},{"id":13018320481353,"name":"Scaruffi 1990s","rank":1381,"scaruffi":7.0}],"n_lists":2}},{"id":243304366426680,"type":"album","name":"The Wayward Bus","artist":"Magnetic Fields","year":1992,"weight":13,"yt":"RYkvePDvjYg","src":"books,charts,musthear","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"list